onal"},{"day":61,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":62,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":63,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":64,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":65,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":66,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":67,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":68,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":69,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":70,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":71,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":72,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":73,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":74,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":75,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":76,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":77,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":78,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":79,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":80,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":81,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":82,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":83,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":84,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":85,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":86,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":87,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":88,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":89,"uw":4,"rank":"global"}],"transcripts":[{"cls":"herald-refused-first","day":81,"mid":"herald","muster":{"present":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenRaw":0,"havenUnique":0,"need":null,"readyProxy":null},"sayDuring":["⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."],"lines":["🚶 a young farmer walks in — pack light, eyes wide. Haven grows by one. (6 souls.)","🐗 RAID — 3 raiders (The Moderator, The Herald, The Big Beast) hit Haven in the night, drawn by the smell of the pantry! The palisade's stakes take their toll as they come over the wall.","🐗⚠️ One of them is bigger than the usual teeth at the door — The Herald came with this raid, and the wall was not built for its kind.","🚨 The Moderator, The Herald, The Big Beast is at Haven's door. The village looks to you. Four ways to call: a RUNNER (slow, dangerous), a SIGNAL FIRE (fast, loud, everyone sees), the SYSTEM RELAY (if it can carry voices), or an ABILITY CRY (if your build has one). Each with honest costs.","Nobody met The Herald — it's still out there at the treeline. It'll gorge every night until it's driven off.","Nobody met The Big Beast — it's still out there at the treeline. It'll gorge every night until it's driven off.","🛡️ Randa met them at the door — 1 driven off.","The watch holds the wall. You sleep through the worst of it — or would have, if the shouting had let you.","Ants march past your boot, laden. You follow them to a seep. +1L water (risky). (ant_trail)","⚠ WARNING: reserves critical. Eat tomorrow or the spiral begins.","Village meal: +2300 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry.","Randa traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs.","Randa is hurt — a fall, a thorn, a bad step. (health 72/100)","Farid and Brian lingered over the fire together.","Randa and Farid lingered over the fire together.","💧 The cistern won't cover today — the hall's call, no vote needed: half rations until the water runs come back.","🤒 Sari is achy and wrung out, barely eating. Rest and clean water — or it gets worse. You're already boiling water. It's handled.","— DAY 80 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","🎁 You find a small bundle tucked where you'll find it. No one saw it left there.","\"They're sending Vex after you tomorrow. He's bored. Be somewhere else.\"","(239 kcal of dried meat and clean water. Nothing traceable.)","Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. By the fire. Good enough.)","The static resolves into something almost like a voice. Almost like yours.","📻 It moves.","Boiled 1L. Bacteria dead. (-35 kcal, 32 ticks tending the fire.)","Drank clean water.","\"HELP ME,\" says the dark, in your friend's voice. Your friend is asleep in the haven.","You catch fragments by the fire — Farid telling Randa about Brian. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning.","You catch fragments by the fire — Brian telling Randa about himself. The retelling is already better than the event.","💬 Jessica says: \"Do you think they're watching right now? The... audience? I try not to think about it.\"","👥 Brian heads out to forage. \"There's food out there. Going to find it.\"","👥 Farid walks out with Brian. \"Nobody walks alone today.\"","💧 Petra returns with water: +3 clean.","💬 Petra has been asking you about Purify — what it does, what it goes with. Planning something.","Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved.","— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","📻 It moves.","— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","Crying, in the dark. A voice you know. It sounds exactly like them — but they're safe at the haven. Aren't they?","(It's bait. Don't walk toward the crying — that feeds it. Stand still, resist, and the act breaks. The signal scrambles once it's exposed — hit it then.)","The village is rattled. Everyone's jumpy — eyes on the treeline.","⚔ THE BIG BEAST! Brian joins you!","Turn-based now. Tap a tile to move — speed is squares. Then act.","Brian doesn't look away. \"About time someone fought back.\"","🐗 This one came with the raid on Haven — it was with the teeth at the door, not a lone wanderer.","(The game is telling you something: this is bigger than one person. Talk to your companions — \"We should name this. Us.\")","🌿 Brian returns from foraging the wilds: +473 kcal to the pantry.","🚶 Farid is back with Brian.","🩹 Petra is hurting (54 HP) — You patch them up before they head out. (54 → 79 HP)","👥 Petra heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\"","👥 Brian walks out with Petra. \"Nobody walks alone today.\"","👥 Randa heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\"","👥 Farid walks out with Randa. \"Nobody walks alone today.\"","— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark.","Night. The treeline is just a sound now. The fire is the whole argument against it.","Brian strikes the Big Beast.","Brian hits radio for 26.","It crackles — and the crying fixes on Brian, furious. Pain gets noticed.","Brian strikes the Big Beast.","Brian hits radio for 24.","radio is BLEEDING — and it likes it. Louder, faster, no more feints.","Too close. The crying STOPS — it has you's voice now.","💥 radio's Voice Drop Rush finds Brian — no dodging it.","Brian's gear absorbs 12.","Radio's Voice Drop Rush hits Brian for 5.","📖 Codex: Voice Drop Rush — gives no warning — it just moves and hits. You won't forget this.","The voice falters... then starts again, somewhere else in the dark. It is still hungry.","(radio's hide absorbs 3.)","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel.","The Big Beast falls.","You STRIKE the radio for 29 (Hatchet).","📺 +5 style — solid hit","📺 +20 style — dropped the Big Beast!","Brian nods, slow. \"Remind me not to cross you.\"","It is a radio. Do not eat the radio.","You came back bloody. Nobody asks. Someone saves you the good seat by the fire.","💛 You hold Mixtape. Hand-labeled: 'FOR THE DRIVE.' No player. The songs are in your head anyway — you hum them when you work, and the work goes faster. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they are with you. The feast was the weapon. (The next feast grants FEASTED until tomorrow's dawn: strikes & abilities uplifted, devotion ×1.5 — richer feasts hit harder.)","Travel 1 tile to creek.","The Herald stops at the boundary — pacing, unwilling. Something else is already here. It's still out there.","Something pads into the clearing — The Herald. It's here.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 2 tiles to trail edge.","It followed you. The Herald is here.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 2 tiles to grove.","It followed you. The Herald is here.","A sturdy stick (crafting material).","You work the patch with practiced hands: 6× Hickory Nuts, 10× Burdock, 10× Blackberry, 10× Purslane (1850 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","The Herald stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there.","While you were gone — one thing you missed:","⚔️ Randa stared down the Moderator and it backed off — 0 rounds, not a scratch on them. It's still out there, somewhere.","You keep a day's food (1980 kcal) and unload 1370 kcal into Haven's pantry.","1 unprocessed haul onto the counter — the clock is ticking.","You walk back into Haven. 49 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","📋 Petra — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","You make a Snare. a loop of vine on a bent stick. catches small game. (10 uses)","Farid speaks only 🇧🇩 Bengali. No shared words at all — just eyes, hands, and patience.","(They mime walking — pointing at themselves, then at you, then toward the trap line. The meaning is unmistakable: come with me.)","Taken: Sinew cord x2, Sinew cord x2.","The body is stripped. What's left isn't worth taking.","✨ Ability gained: Lucky Rock (L1). Your lucky rock. The System finds your faith adorable and helps a little: +5% on the hunt. (It’s not the rock. It’s you believing in the rock.)","\"The rock! It is lucky! We checked! It's... a rock! But YOU believe! Belief is power! (We added 4%.)\"","\"Earned, not given. You did the work — we just wrote it down.\"","You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you.","🎣 Petra worked the creek — 1 fish, +140 kcal to the pantry.","You catch fragments by the fire — Brian telling Randa about you. It's picking up decorations as it travels.","🚶 Mara Vasquez walks in — pack light, eyes wide. Haven grows by one. (7 souls.)","🌙 Night. The lingering The Herald gorges at the treeline — 1,120 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk.","🗣️ Mara to Randa, by the fire: \"Why them? ...Sorry. It's just sitting there, and they're the one who has to sit in it.\"","Rain. Steady, cold, honest rain.","Ants march past your boot, laden. You follow them to a seep. +1L water (risky). (ant_trail)","⚠ WARNING: reserves critical. Eat tomorrow or the spiral begins.","Village meal: +2200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry.","Someone told a joke by the fire. You hear Petra laugh — a real one.","Mara had the day of their life — 1432 kcal. Two days of food from one person.","Mara and Sari lingered over the fire together.","🤒 Randa is feverish, a cut gone hot and angry. Rest and clean water — or it gets worse.","Mara sits with Sari — cool cloth, bitter tea, watching the breathing.","Mara sits with Randa — cool cloth, bitter tea, watching the breathing.","🛟 Brian stands up by the fire. \"People are going down and the tents are filling — we do something or we don't, but we decide. Here's what we CAN do — pick one, maybe two, but everything costs something.\"","\"We can nurse them through it, or go lean and ride it out, or send the strong out hunting while the sick rest. Say which.\"","\"Or we rally,\" Brian adds. \"Second shift, everybody. We work, we eat, we live — and we pay for it.\"","(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)","📖 LEARNED: Pattern Recognition (Level 2). Deeper understanding of pattern recognition.","📖 LEARNED: Come Get Some (Level 2). You can goad a statue into flinching.","🌟 JACKPOT: A stranger by the road knows things. They talk for an hour. You learn: Pattern Recognition, Come Get Some. Your Codex overflows.","— DAY 81 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","Overnight, Purslane; Blackberry; Mister Never (cleaned); Hickory Nuts (in shell) went bad — beyond saving. You leave them for the flies.","Fresh food keeps days, not weeks. Smoke it over a fire to make it last.","👀 Brian pronounced a Denver place-name the way someone reads it off a map for the first time. Nobody from there says it that way.","Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. Your sleeping body burned less — 3 kcal conserved. By the fire. Good enough.)","Boiled 1L. Bacteria dead. (-35 kcal, 32 ticks tending the fire.)","Drank clean water.","📯 It moves.","You catch fragments by the fire — Petra telling Mara about Sari. Half of it's true anymore. You're not sure which half.","Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved.","— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","Its posture changes. Curiosity is over.","🚶 Farid is back with Randa.","💧 Randa returns with water: +3 clean.","— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","📯 It moves.","⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."]}],"musterRefusals":[{"idx":0,"day":81,"sayText":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic.","have":0,"need":10,"musterExists":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenValid":0,"readyManual":false,"readyGame":false,"omenStage":2,"omenDay":69,"links":[{"villageId":"village_0","name":"Emberhold","trust":100,"opinion":-1,"arrears":0,"quota":2,"facesFree":0,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":0},{"villageId":"village_1","name":"Stonebridge","trust":93,"opinion":12,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":9,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":6},{"villageId":"village_2","name":"Thornfield","trust":81,"opinion":12,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"faces