r notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."],"lines":["OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): Chantal fights on a full belly.","Chantal hits eulogy for 14.","Too close. The eulogy's attention SNAPS to you — proximity overrules patience.","📖 The Eulogy narrates, honestly, always: \"and then they ran, and the spotlight followed.\" The spotlight narrows. Your dodge feels watched. (-10% dodge.) (4 verses remain. Contradict it — do the opposite — or give it a better ending.)","💥 It connects!","Armor absorbs 16.","Chantal shouts: \"Move! MOVE!\"","Eulogy's attack hits you for 39.","📖 Codex: Final Chapter — strikes one target after a windup. You won't forget this.","(eulogy's hide absorbs 8.)","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel.","You STRIKE the eulogy for 88 (Phase blade).","📺 +5 style — solid hit","Chantal patches you up (+12 HP). \"Hold still!\"","Too close. The eulogy's attention SNAPS to Chantal — proximity overrules patience.","📖 The Eulogy narrates, honestly, always: \"and then they bled, politely, where everyone could see.\" The narration lingers on your wounds. (Bleeds last 1 round longer.) (3 verses remain. Contradict it — do the opposite — or give it a better ending.)","💥 Final Chapter!","Armor absorbs 19.","Eulogy's Final Chapter hits you for 44.","Chantal strikes the Eulogy.","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): Chantal fights on a full belly.","Chantal hits eulogy for 14.","📖 The Eulogy narrates, honestly, always: \"and then they knelt, and the story approved.\" The story leans in. (The Eulogy's attacks +15.) (2 verses remain. Contradict it — do the opposite — or give it a better ending.)","💥 eulogy's attack finds Chantal — no dodging it.","Chantal's gear absorbs 18.","Eulogy's attack hits Chantal for 24.","📖 Codex: Epitaph — locks onto one target — moving won't dodge it. You won't forget this.","Chantal stops mid-fight and binds the wound — field medicine, +20 HP.","📖 The Eulogy narrates, honestly, always: \"and then — this is the last line — they ended.\" The last line hangs in the air. (It finishes next round.) (1 verse remain. Contradict it — do the opposite — or give it a better ending.)","💥 Final Chapter!","Chantal's gear absorbs 27.","Eulogy's Final Chapter hits Chantal for 36.","Chantal strikes the Eulogy.","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): Chantal fights on a full belly.","Chantal hits eulogy for 18.","📖 \"...they ended.\" The last line lands like a lid. (The story finishes — you die as narrated.)","Armor absorbs 2957.","You go down.","📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Vlada Tikhomirova is dead. You didn't ask. It knew.","Nobody's talking much. The fire feels smaller tonight.","🕯️ Vlada is dead — and the dead hold no treaties. Every link Haven has shakes.","Emberhold watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 1,688 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it.","Stonebridge watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 1,688 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it.","Ashford watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 1,688 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it.","🕯️ Vlada Tikhomirova is dead — the wild. The village stops. Somebody screams. Somebody else starts digging.","What Vlada kept close goes into the ground with them — keepsakes are buried, never taken from the body.","\"Vlada's gone.\" Priya looks at you for a long moment. \"You're not Vlada.\" No heat in it. Just fact. You'll have to earn this face.","The Codex doesn't pause for grief. Theo blinks — and it's already there, overlaying everything, syncing. No pen. No paper. The mantle just... transfers.","📖 LEARNED: Patient Aim (Level 1). One shot. You don't take the shot unless it's the shot.","📖 LEARNED: Debris Shelter (Level 1). A lean-to of branches and leaves beats nothing. Dead air is insulation.","📖 LEARNED: Cordage (Level 1). Twist plant fibers into string. Dogbane, nettle, yucca — strong fibers are everywhere.","🌟 \"MANTLE TRANSFER DETECTED. ...Oh! New face! Same job! Whole new set of tricks. We hardly noticed. (That is a lie. We noticed. The audience CRIED.)\"","📖 The Codex turns a page: Vlada Tikhomirova, 146 days. The mantle passes to Theo Lindqvist.","🪞 You wake up somebody else. Theo Lindqvist, 24 — a trail crew lead. His hands know different work now: Night Eyes, Lucky Rock, Echo Location, Trophy Room.","◈ The System updates its file: the new bearer <redacted> \"Stalker of the Apex Predator.\" It had a word for this one before the Codex came.","The village's quarrel was with Vlada — and Vlada is dead. The sentence doesn't cross the grave. You're someone else now; the docket is empty, but the village remembers.","You knew Vlada — not the office, the person. The fire keeps expecting her, and so do you. That's a heavier kind of stepping up. (+5 trauma)","At the grave, Victor, Gilberto, Hana and 5 more speak for Theo — \"Vlada trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens.","The fire knew Theo before the Codex did — his name already carried weight here.","You are full enough.","Took Foraged food (dried).","You eat Foraged food (dried) (154 kcal).","Your chewing echoes off the trees. Something out there heard. (encounters more likely tomorrow)","📯 It moves.","Took Foraged food (dried).","You eat Foraged food (dried) (153 kcal).","Took Foraged food (dried).","You eat Foraged food (dried) (160 kcal).","Took Foraged food (dried).","You eat Foraged food (dried) (160 kcal).","Took Foraged food (dried).","You eat Foraged food (dried) (160 kcal).","\"Can we talk?\" Greta sits down near you. \"Just... talk. Like people used to.\" (Talk to Greta.)","You catch fragments by the fire — Priya telling Victor about herself. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning.","Gilberto heads out to check the snares. \"Wire doesn't lie.\"","💧 Hana returns with water: +3 clean.","— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark.","No watches tonight. Everyone sleeps with one ear open and pretends not to.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","💛 You hold Dispatcher's headset. Breathe. The shaking eases. (−6 trauma)","Travel 1 tile to grove.","It followed you. The Herald is here.","You catch fragments by the fire — Gilberto telling Elijah about Priya. It's picking up decorations as it travels.","You catch fragments by the fire — Victor telling Elijah about themself. The story's getting bigger than what happened.","You work the patch with practiced hands: 9× Muscadine Grapes (810 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days.","(The snare wire becomes the snare — improvised, 2 uses.)","You set a Snare here. Check it tomorrow.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","The Herald stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there.","You keep a day's food (810 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time.","You walk back into Haven. 55 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you.","💧 Elijah returns with water: +2 clean.","🥩 Chantal is back empty-handed. \"Nothing worth hauling out there.\"","💧 Miguel returns with water: +3 clean.","Elijah is tending the fire, coaxing it steady.","🌙 Night. The lingering The Herald gorges at the treeline — 1,200 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk.","🌙 Night. The lingering Big-Eyes gorges at the treeline — 800 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk.","It's settled. The village is calling it \"Big Loud.\" The Codex keeps it.","◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+2 integration)","⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. You went to bed on an empty stomach.","Village meal: +2200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry.","🩹 You make rounds — Chantal gets bound up properly. (35 → 50 HP)","The fire is quiet today. Nobody's talking much.","Chantal is showing everyone Spicebush by the fire. \"See the leaves? Like that. Don't mix it up.\" The Codex grows — the human way.","Greta sets aside time with Big Loud flesh. Look, smell, touch — then the smallest taste, and wait. An hour passes. Calm stomach. Another hour. Nothing. \"It's food,\" Greta tells the fire. \"You know it in your gut. Literally.\" The Codex notes it.","Elijah traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs.","Miguel and Priya lingered over the fire together.","🍽️ Miguel eyes the groaning pantry shelves and packs light today. \"No point hauling what'll rot. Mending the nets instead.\"","🍽️ Elijah leaves the surplus by the fire for whoever's hungry. \"The pantry can't take it. We can.\"","Your Snare 1 tile north sits empty — nothing it can catch is moving on this ground. Try another tile.","The garden is going weedy — your Burdock needs tending, or the harvest halves.","The garden is going weedy — your Burdock needs tending, or the harvest halves.","🌪️ THE HERALD struck Stonebridge in the night. They bled while the coalition talked. (trust −5 — they notice who wasn't there.)","— DAY 147 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","Overnight, unknown berries went bad — beyond saving. You leave it for the flies.","Fresh food keeps days, not weeks. Smoke it over a fire to make it last.","On the carcass nearby, The Mountain Lord (carcass) went bad — maggots, smell, the whole sad story. Leaving it had a cost.","📦 A care package drops from the sky with a little parachute. There's a note: \"WE LOVE YOU! — your showbiz fans\"","Inside: Living Soil Robes","Plus 46 kcal of fan-approved snacks.","💬 Chantal says: \"Wren again. There was food by the hollow this morning — good food. Don't ask me how I know it wasn't one of us.\"","Victor kneels and asks. The land answers: 8 bellies full in Haven today. (Feed the Multitude)","Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. By the fire. Good enough.)","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","Equipped Living Soil Robes (torso).","👂 Overheard — Hana: \"The third incident followed the same interval as the first two. That's not weather.\"","👂 Overheard — Greta: \"Steady on. We'll get there.\"","👂 Greta \"Don't just stand there — you've got opinions, right?\"","\"Can we talk?\" Hana sits down near you. \"Just... talk. Like people used to.\" (Talk to Hana.)","👂 Overheard — Hana: \"Wait — say that again? I want to check the logic.\"","👂 Overheard — Greta: \"Steady on. We'll get there.\"","You catch fragments by the fire — Elijah telling Hana about Gilberto. Half of it's true anymore. You're not sure which half.","Hana heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\"","Priya sets out to find Victor. \"Won't be long.\"","Miguel heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\"","Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved.","— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","Its posture changes. Curiosity is over.","💧 Victor returns with water: +2 clean.","🪤 Gilberto is back. \"Snares were empty. They'll keep.\"","Elijah heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\"","🩹 Chantal is hurting (53 HP) — You patch them up before they head out. (53 → 78 HP)","Chantal sets out for Sweeps Week. \"Meat's meat. Back with it or not at all.\"","— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","📯 It moves.","⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."]}],"musterRefusals":[{"idx":0,"day":147,"sayText":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic.","have":0,"need":10,"musterExists":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenValid":0,"readyManual":false,"readyGame":false,"omenStage":2,"omenDay":137,"links":[{"villageId":"village_0","name":"Emberhold","trust":92,"opinion":40,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":10,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":6},{"villageId":"village_1","name":"Stonebridge","trust":82,"opinion":31,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":0,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":0},{"villageId":"village_3","name":"Ashford","trust":81,"opinion":27,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":0,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":0}],"linksActive":3,"callYield":6,"callOffered":true,"commitOffered":true,"volunteers":3,"outcomesPrior":0,"callsSoFar":{"soundTitanCall":0,"titanCommitOwn":0,"titanSelfDo":0,"titanWarCouncil":0}},{"idx":1,"day":148,"sayText":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic.","have":0,"need":10,"musterExists":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenValid":0,"readyManual":false,"readyGame":false,"omenStage":2,"omenDay":137,"links":[{"villageId":"village_0","name":"Emberhold","trust":92,"opinion":40,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":10,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":6},{"villageId":"village_1","name":"Stonebridge","trust":82,"opinion":31,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":0,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":0},{"villageId":"village_3","name":"Ashford","trust":81,"opinion":27,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":0,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYiel